        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-CSD2008SMTSBR, Solid Brass Half Circle Door Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Half Moon Door Pull Set is a great addition to storefront doors as well as other commercial applications. Its modern design makes it an attractive handle for residential front doors as well. The Solid Brass Half Circle Door Handle Pair comes packaged with 2 half circles meant to be mounted on one side of a pair of double doors. It can be surface mounted or thru-bolt mounted. It is 8 inches long with 5 inch center to center mounting. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions PR-CSD2008SMTSBR Cascade Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.46\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CSD02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262332\"><b>First Impressions PR-CSD2008SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 door pull handles).</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Half Moon Door Pull Set",
                "description": "The Half Moon Door Pull Set is a great addition to storefront doors as well as other commercial applications. Its modern design makes it an attractive handle for residential front doors as well. The Solid Brass Half Circle Door Handle Pair comes packaged with 2 half circles meant to be mounted on one side of a pair of double doors. It can be surface mounted or thru-bolt mounted. It is 8 inches long with 5 inch center to center mounting. \r\n",
